  m_Name: CrownPrincessXtara
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Crown Princess X'tara
  role: 1
  description: 'The war crazed 1st daughter of The Emperor of Draconis Imperialis
    who abdicated her claim on the throne to pursue a military career. A white dragon
    in golden armor with the Dragon Hierarch''s 15 health and Armor Level 2, but
    100% accuracy. Her Imperial Igniter (a Flamethrower: 5 shots of 10 damage whatever
    the armor, 10 m) burns out living soldiers, and her Dragon Claw (5 damage, penetration
    1, 2 m) takes over when an enemy is within 2 m. Imperial Mandate: friendly Biological
    soldiers within 15 m get +1 penetration. She moves 30 m (60 m sprinting). Unique.
    A Commander: every army needs exactly one.'
